perf(crew): gate snapshot reuse on a fresh liveness reading

Reuse a snapshot only while both the file stat identity and a fresh liveness
reading hold. The liveness comes from the same host-gated reader that
classify_pointer uses, taken every poll. The poll's own moment supplies the
clock-derived fields, so a patched clock reaches them.
